 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Not creepy, just popular. Lots of people find them gripping, especially real stories about crime. It' the little thriller, and it's real, which makes it juicier. Would you like the true story behind a famous case, or the latest one? It depends how it' done. A well researched podcast that treats the case with respect can be a way to keep their story alive. That's fine, as long as they don't mock the victims. A good laugh can go hand in hand with grief. Good for you. Your sister might even give it try with one she likes.",
